{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52846","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 齐光乂","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚岁朝真隐，皇情谅不违。\n辞家五十载，今日复东归。\n祖帐临青道，天章降紫微。\n顾嗟轩冕者，谁与比光辉？\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐光乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}